WEBVTT

00:12:28.681 --> 00:12:34.169
What we need is the will
and the insistence of Americans

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.436
that we treat children humanely.

00:12:40.663 --> 00:12:45.672
You know, I can't forget
Danny or Fernando.

00:12:46.339 --> 00:12:48.151
I wonder where they are today,

00:12:48.175 --> 00:12:50.528
and I pray that they
are healthy and happy.

00:12:51.594 --> 00:12:53.713
They are only two
of the many children I met

00:12:53.737 --> 00:12:56.774
and of the thousands we know about
who have been in detention.

00:12:58.528 --> 00:13:01.161
I may be saddened